      },
      "Height": 493,
      "Shadow": {
        "Color": "#E9E9E9",
        "Enabled": false,
        "Radius": 0
      },
      "Text": "Assess review priority as of December 15, 2025, with quarter-end\nDecember 31.\n\nApply these rules in order:\n\nHigh: the open deal\u2019s close date is overdue; an explicit blocker\nprevents a planned Q4 close; or inactivity exceeds 30 days and\nthe note describes an unresolved blocker.\n\nMedium: any other unresolved blocker, inactivity over 30 days,\nor no recorded activity.\n\nLow: a close date is present, activity is within 30 days, and\nthe note explicitly indicates progress without outstanding blockers.\n\nOtherwise: Insufficient information.\n\nUse primary_blocker as context, but check the note for evidence.\nRecent contact does not cancel an unresolved blocker.\nThis is review priority, not a probability of losing the deal.",
      "Width": 425
    }
  },
